[{"title":"感皇恩 其一 初任官所为慈闱寿","author":"赵孟坚","text":"官小宦游初，清贫如旧。\n小簇杯盘旋篘酒。\n虽然微禄，不比他们丰厚。\n也知惭愧是，皇恩受。\n富贵千般，享之惟寿。\n心地平时到头有。\n摩挲铜狄，祝望比他长久。\n鼎来荣贵待，通闺后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感皇恩 其二 次任为慈围寿，是年慈闱六十二岁本命后一年也","author":"赵孟坚","text":"一百二十年，两番甲子。\n前番风霜饱谙矣。\n今番甲子，一似腊尽春至。\n程程有好在，应惭愧。\n莫道官贫，胜如无底。\n随分杯筵称家计。\n从今数去，尚有五十八生朝里。\n待儿官大，做奢遮会。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓦山溪 其二 怨别","author":"赵孟坚","text":"桃花雨动，测测轻寒小。\n曲槛面危阑，对东风、伤春怀抱。\n酒边心事，花下旧闲情，流年度，芳尘杳，懊恼人空老。\n粉红题字，寄与分明道。\n消息燕归时，辗柔茵、连天芳草。\n琐窗孤影，夜卜烛花明，清漏断，月朦胧，挂在梅梢袅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓦山溪 其一 初改官为慈闱寿","author":"赵孟坚","text":"几年修绩，总待荣亲老。\n每羡院南豪，向寿席、花花草草。\n如今惭愧，微胜十年前，聊尔办，杯盘了，一对慈颜笑。\n愿亲强健，绿鬓长长好。\n来岁在琴堂，想凡事、应微热闹。\n契天交道，只办好心肠，官尽大，尽荣亲，待受金花诰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙 岩桂和韵","author":"赵孟坚","text":"明金点染，枝头初见，四出如将刀剪。\n芳心才露一些儿，早已被、西风传遍。\n归来醉也，香凝襟袖，疑向广寒宫殿。\n便须著个胆瓶儿，夜深在、枕屏根畔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双溪桥亭","author":"赵孟禹","text":"东溪西溪双合流，凫鸟鸥鸟相和鸣。\n斯景逼人描不得，沧浪一曲浣尘缨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题桃","author":"赵孟淳","text":"滴粉挼酥晕几重，风前红雨一枝浓。\n世间是色皆为妄，除却夭桃单种松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题高尚书夜山图二首 其二","author":"赵孟淳","text":"江行山立月盘桓，有客无言楼上看。\n清兴肯随城漏尽，夜深风露恐高寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题高尚书夜山图二首 其一","author":"赵孟淳","text":"月底江山如昼好，楼中几席与秋清。\n剡藤不到高人手，一段风流可得成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谷","author":"赵孟淳","text":"农夫怨，农夫怨，此怨非是怨年荒，此怨翻因年谷贱。\n终年辛苦不少懈，及到秋成拟偿债。\n谁知斛粟不百钱，利尚不偿本仍在。\n秋来露冷刈穫时，早是朝来债又催。\n况兼荒政输官急，不管农夫垂泪泣。\n君王明哲洞无遗，此怨君王知不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅","author":"赵孟淳","text":"雪意垂垂浸碧虚，香生一缕上琴书。\n何须百万西湖宅，遇有梅花便可居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"赵孟淳","text":"落花遇雨扫不去，败草经春刬又生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花","author":"赵孟谦","text":"荣魁鹗荐。\n一举南宫膺妙选。\n人物规模。\n楚楚吾家千里驹。\n彩衣持酒。\n更祝二亲无限寿。\n父子荣迁。\n俱侍玉皇香案前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆侍郎 其三","author":"赵孟僖","text":"幸逢八秩庆生申，搦管濡毫洒翰新。\n十字顶头添个丿，八千岁寿迈庄椿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆侍郎 其一","author":"赵孟僖","text":"不恋持荷侍玉皇，再从均燕似山堂。\n世间何物侔清节，照水梅花傲雪霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆侍郎 其二","author":"赵孟僖","text":"去年腊月正兹时，曾逐宾尘献寿诗。\n今岁威仪多胜旧，子孙显达福累□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆侍郎 其四","author":"赵孟僖","text":"渭川此际载非熊，紫诏行颁玉殿东。\n正好促装趋北阙，元正端的拜三公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终口占","author":"赵孟僩","text":"王室之懿，文山之客。\n持此寸心，千古忠赤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"赵宗万","text":"斗悬金印心难动，屏列春山眼暂开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷","author":"赵宗吉","text":"天风吹尽蔽空云，叠嶂层峦势吐吞。\n铁笛声沉人换世，幔亭宴罢竹生孙。\n昆阆境界烟霞窟，洙泗源流道义门。\n分治优游公事了，溪山佳处共清尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日宴浮金亭","author":"赵宗德","text":"东山树，何青青。\n镡津水，何泠泠。\n茂树可荫，流水可听。\n眉山夫子能解事，却于水边树下构危亭。\n洪波浴日金错落，瘴云不雨烟濛溟。\n风尘澒洞去天远，草木蓊郁知地灵。\n监州为爱黄华节，携我登临邀众客。\n假令有酒多似藤江水，岂能洗我胸中之郁抑。\n甘侯昆玉文武全，倾盖交游五情热。\n故人亦有许判官，清政平生心似铁。\n文采风流喻幕宾，曾陪骢马清南越。\n刘君元是薇省郎，治民有道多筹策。\n令簿怀才亦不群，芳名皆在斯文列。\n儒林龚魏两茂学，逸气直与青云接。\n孟嘉落帽是何年，岸帻西风感前哲。\n天荒地老事茫茫，白发无情满头雪。\n醒时饮，醉时歌。\n尊前要使衰颜酡，不饮奈此清兴何。\n人生聚会能有几，江海亲旧今无多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵大受冷清生活与赋拙何异","author":"赵帘溪","text":"群鸡今无术，乘风拟学仙。\n登临皆雀跃，酬倡欲蝉联。\n坐久昏钟定，□迟夜漏传。\n南中□福地，此是一□天。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵大受游乳洞谩赋","author":"赵帘溪","text":"等閒过似得明珠，三洞山行喜自如。\n俗客□□寻□处，仙人何必好楼居。\n石声玉磬传空谷，水色冰壶照碧虚。\n便好结茅采芝木，利名尽委绝交书。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"赵庚","text":"腰金不足为公重，怀宝无瑕乃席珍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":45999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李长吉集","author":"赵庚夫","text":"几回掩却又重看，吟罢心如着露兰。\n欲上玉楼窥老笔，虬龙拥处雪霜寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"习气","author":"赵庚夫","text":"习气年来已尽除，一窗长是读方书。\n家因护竹厨无笋，住偶邻僧饭有蔬。\n老去情怀多感旧，贫来亲故不如初。\n几时深入青山隐，木叶为衣稳跨驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居苦","author":"赵庚夫","text":"栽松成曲径，洗石出秋屏。\n米价占新月，更筹认曙星。\n买牛邻共契，祭灶妇看经。\n不觉成头白，频看烧地青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书田舍所见","author":"赵庚夫","text":"海上多风色，青山与屋齐。\n禾堆深卧犬，树杪忽闻鸡。\n白酒清无曲，青裙老未笄。\n主人偏道气，被褐自扶犁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"友人别墅","author":"赵庚夫","text":"买山仍近水，结屋又安坟。\n此举堪惊世，馀年独羡君。\n钓舟须共载，禅榻亦平分。\n切莫施门户，□藏恐碍云。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"心宇","author":"赵庚夫","text":"心宇今无一点尘，面毛径寸垢生鳞。\n斋时野雀临芗几，定里山蜂立葛巾。\n欲唤羲黄谈太古，自疑嵇阮即前身。\n儿童共指深衣笑，问是秦人是晋人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同僧游?阳塘上生院","author":"赵庚夫","text":"沿堤上下看沙鸥，得句支筇自点头。\n风露高时将鹤伴，溪山好处载僧游。\n老无志愿惟渔艇，閒有功夫上寺楼。\n岁晚渊明须自笑，督邮未至合归休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论诗","author":"赵庚夫","text":"未得归山养圣胎，凭谁轻脱出山来。\n老犹作态经霜柳，静有馀妍照水梅。\n大小场知惟酒户，浅深难说是诗才。\n吟翁终欲招田父，只话桑麻共一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看梅","author":"赵庚夫","text":"竟日梅花侧，枝枝入肺肝。\n湿疑霜旋剪，清比玉堪餐。\n临水严光钓，吟风东野寒。\n年来难取友，珍重莫吹残。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病足","author":"赵庚夫","text":"老病侵陵药不灵，雪窗灯火冷如萤。\n未应安隐青莲足，便学蹁跹病鹤形。\n意恐梦中轻献璞，怒思天上去鞭霆。\n露华水泡何堪惜，独念名山未遍经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真州听角","author":"赵庚夫","text":"画角听时恨最深，戍楼偏在女墙阴。\n声寒恐有新霜落，意远未随红日沉。\n凉月一天孤雁影，秋风万里狂夫心。\n连宵只解搜诗意，哀怨何曾动羽林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读曾茶山诗集","author":"赵庚夫","text":"茶山八十二癯仙，千首新诗手自编。\n吟到瘴烟因避寇，贵登从橐只栖禅。\n新于月出初三夜，澹比汤煎第一泉。\n咄咄逼人门弟子，剑南已见祖灯传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄广右方提刑","author":"赵庚夫","text":"节旄昨下九疑山，图画仙真上界还。\n巡历半经三管地，笑谈尽伏五溪蛮。\n受恩人拜祠堂下，留墨神呵古洞间。\n早晚归班论边琐，有书时遣扣柴关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄建康老友","author":"赵庚夫","text":"朋旧多随秋叶风，与君心赏向来同。\n十年相忆头先白，万里重分途更穷。\n莼菜虽堪誇洛下，酒樽终是忆江东。\n自从学道全无梦，直待亲逢紫陌中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清泉","author":"赵庚夫","text":"清泉煮茗自甘肥，诗卷新来十大围。\n衰齿尚能餐枸杞，馀龄断未泣牛衣。\n每思削发游方去，时梦乘云谒帝归。\n何世独无勋业士，古来惟有逸民稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐逸","author":"赵庚夫","text":"落魄蕉衫戴道冠，菖蒲满案浸清寒。\n有钱即买丹砂炼，无病犹将素问看。\n连日游山僧共住，频年乞米鹤同餐。\n世间不朽非钟鼎，曾与高人静处观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道中逢潜夫","author":"赵庚夫","text":"相逢投草舍，对雨话移时。\n衣湿全无火，囊空各有诗。\n客程樵可问，日课仆皆知。\n未别情先恶，那堪远别离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题孔道士云庵","author":"赵庚夫","text":"道人居玉笥，手辟小蓬莱。\n门寂山相对，庵空云自来。\n茶烟朝宛转，丹气夜昭回。\n欲助梨花梦，携锄独种梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题张山人幽居","author":"赵庚夫","text":"昔隐君平卜，今闻事又非。\n肘犹悬蠹简，身止挂鹑衣。\n芒屦沿山去，茅檐讲易归。\n先儒皆若此，切莫叹时违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹤食","author":"赵庚夫","text":"鹤食从妻给，花窠课子锄。\n绝粮缘买砚，止酒为耽书。\n野服迎人懒，禅心涉世疏。\n丹炉添火候，健似十年初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鬓髭","author":"赵庚夫","text":"鬓髭渐渐长霜茎，老听山中雀唳声。\n九死得生尤可重，百年几日更多营。\n自参梵夹机心息，专食藜羹胃气清。\n检点依然魔障在，草堂钓艇未忘情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事","author":"赵庚夫","text":"连夜缝纫办，今朝杵臼频。\n买花簪稚女，送米赠穷邻。\n宦薄唯名在，年华与鬓新。\n桃符诗句好，恐动往来人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"赵庚夫","text":"君家自在剑山外，莫浪江南劝路人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46022,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"赵庚夫","text":"鹤残篱外笋，鼠舐墨中胶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46023,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"赵庚夫","text":"诗句日从窗眼写，墨丸夜入枕头收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46024,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷","author":"赵承禧","text":"群玉山前隐道园，松声鹤唳隔溪闻。\n山灵似识游人意，要看青林映白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46025,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"婆罗门引","author":"赵昂","text":"暮霞照水，水边无数木芙蓉。\n晓来露湿轻红。\n十里锦丝步障，日转影重重。\n向楚天空迥，人立西风。\n夕阳道中。\n叹秋色、与愁浓。\n寂寞三千粉黛，临鉴妆慵。\n施朱太赤，空惆怅、教妾若为容。\n花易老、烟水无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46026,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜英公大师相访","author":"赵昌言","text":"僧中何事最闻名，笔札高奇是梦英。\n十八家书垂墨妙，一千年圣遇文明。\n未将六籍重刊石，已驾三车到化城。\n此日劳师相枉访，豁然襟抱慰平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46027,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白府真君","author":"赵杰之","text":"卓茂当年政术优，治声终不似贤侯。\n显幽一致施仁化，庙食中山卒未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46028,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓鳌亭","author":"赵杰之","text":"天地分来万古多，鳌鱼背稳驾山河。\n亭前见说高人钓，池上那闻渔父歌。\n四面青峰环秀色，一湾绿水漾清波。\n谁能掣断黄金索，终日持竿怎奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46029,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其七","author":"赵构","text":"骇浪吞舟脱巨鳞，结绳为网也难任。\n纶乍放，饵初沉，浅钓纤鳞味更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46030,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其八","author":"赵构","text":"鱼信还催花信开，花风得得为谁来。\n舒柳眼，落梅腮，浪煖桃花夜转雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46031,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其十","author":"赵构","text":"远水无涯山有邻，相看岁晚更情亲。\n笛里月，酒中身，举头无我一般人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46032,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其十二","author":"赵构","text":"水涵微雨湛虚明，小笠轻蓑未要晴。\n明鉴里，縠纹生，白鹭飞来空外声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46033,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其十四","author":"赵构","text":"春入渭阳花气多，春归时节自清和。\n冲晓雾，弄沧波，载与俱归又若何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46034,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其六","author":"赵构","text":"侬家活计岂能名，万顷波心月影清。\n倾绿酒，糁藜羹，保任衣中一物灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46035,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其四","author":"赵构","text":"青草开时已过船，锦鳞跃处浪痕圆。\n竹叶酒，柳花毡，有意沙鸥伴我眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46036,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其十三","author":"赵构","text":"无数菰蒲閒藕花，棹歌轻举酌流霞。\n随家好，转山斜，也有孤村三两家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46037,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其九","author":"赵构","text":"莫莫朝朝冬复春，高车驷马趁朝身。\n金拄屋，粟盈囷，那知江汉独醒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46038,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其一","author":"赵构","text":"一湖春水夜来生，几叠春山远更横。\n烟艇小，钓丝轻，赢得闲中万古名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46039,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父词 其二","author":"赵构","text":"薄晚烟林淡翠微，江边秋月已明晖。\n纵远抱，适天机，水底闲云片段飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46040,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙鹤楼","author":"赵泽","text":"嘉陵天虹饮东海，西溪玉带萦南山。\n诸峰四面罗髻鬟，周遭百里如一环。\n炊烟万灶斜阳里，繁弦脆管东风起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46041,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"县厅书事","author":"袁采","text":"庭下幽花照眼醒，绿阴成幄晚风清。\n何时抛掷铜章去，小艇烟波弄月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46042,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘泉洞","author":"赵泽祖","text":"银河泻落万山巅，玉界遥驰一道泉。\n夜浴丹沙浮暖气，晓凝寒碧沁晴烟。\n灵泉透海流香细，雪液澄虚抱影圆。\n三咽只因凡骨换，坐临盘石看飞钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46043,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"赵知军","text":"战血肥春草，妖魂附野狐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46044,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨妃菊","author":"赵肃远","text":"元是马嵬山下魄，脱胎今复对西风。\n当时若使三郎见，又自东篱召入宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":46045,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]